<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30538" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχᾰρ-άσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχά̆ρ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>engrave</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>
			<i>upon</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				2.55
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς στάλλαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(2).67
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Mytilene</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὸ ἱερόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>GDI</u>
					2322.16
				</span></i>
			 (Delph.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Per.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Them.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			; <i>insert</i> in a document, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CPR</u>
				19.18
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>: metaph., <i>imitate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὸν Ἀντισθένειον τύπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					7.217a
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐγκεχαραγμένα ἀγαθά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					666.17
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγάλως
				ἐγκεχαραγμένος</span>
			<i>with a</i> great <i>record</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Charito
				2.6
			</span></i>; of coins, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				58
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δραχμαὶ ἐγκεχαραγμέναι γράμμασιν
					Ἑλληνικοῖς ἐπίσημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Peripl.M.Rubr.</u>
					47
				</span></i>
			; of soldiers, <i>to be entered on a muster-roll</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				5.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to</i>
			<i>make an incision into</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				5.38.2
			</span></i>; <i>scarify</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				7.16.3
			</span></i>.</div>
